2. This writ application has been filed for the following relief;
"In view of the facts and circumstances stated above it is humbly prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to;
1) Issue Rule Nisi in the nature of Mandamus and/or any other appropriate writ/writs, order/orders, direction/directions calling upon the Opp. Parties to show cause as to why the land acquisition compensation amount of Rs.1,64,49,756/-
awarded in respect of acquisition of Petitioners land measuring an area of Ac.0.055 dec. of Hal Plot No.749, Kissam- Gharabari-1, under Hal Khata No.53, Mouza- Unit No.3 Routrapur, Dist.;- Jajpur shall not be paid to them along with interest;
And II) If the Opp. Parties fail to show cause or show insufficient cause or false cause, make the said Rule absolute.
